── success
POST /users → 201  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"id":"u-1","email":"bob@example.com"}

── no content
DELETE /users/u-1 → 204

── validation
POST /users → 400  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"INVALID","message":"field email is invalid","details":{"email":"is required"},"correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── malformed body
POST /users → 400  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"INVALID","message":"field body is invalid","details":{"body":"invalid character 'n' looking for beginning of object key string"},"correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── invalid
POST /fail → 400  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"INVALID","message":"field email is invalid","details":{"email":"must be an address"},"correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── not found
POST /fail → 404  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"NOT_FOUND","message":"user u-9 not found","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── conflict
POST /fail → 409  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"CONFLICT","message":"user already exists","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── unauthenticated
POST /fail → 401  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"UNAUTHENTICATED","message":"no bearer token","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── permission denied
POST /fail → 403  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"PERMISSION_DENIED","message":"not allowed to users:delete","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── unavailable
POST /fail → 503  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"UNAVAILABLE","message":"postgres is unavailable","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── internal
POST /fail → 500  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"INTERNAL","message":"internal error","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── unknown path
GET /nope → 404  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"NOT_FOUND","message":"no route for GET /nope","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

── wrong method
PATCH /users/u-1 → 405  Allow: DELETE, GET, HEAD  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
{"error":{"code":"INVALID","message":"PATCH is not allowed on /users/u-1","correlation_id":"<id>"}}

